188 0 obj
<</E(The primary vision of 180 Degrees Consulting, VNIT has always been to bring about tangible change in the society. It has been our drive to ensure that we promote a culture of excellence in whatever work we undertake, and push for the highest standards of quality. We try our best to transform the lives of people around us, inspire a sense of collective belongingness and create real social impact on the ground. With good planning, comes good implementation, and we work with great dedication towards ensuring that we constantly improve upon our existing strengths and create the leaders of the future. )/Pg 12 0 R /S/H3/T(The primary vision of 180 Degrees Consulting, VNIT has always been to bring about tangible change in the society. It has been our drive to ensure that we promote a culture of excellence in whatever work we undertake, and push for the highest standards of quality. We try our best to transform the lives of people around us, inspire a sense of collective belongingness and create real social impact on the ground. With good planning, comes good implementation, and we work with great dedication towards ensuring that we constantly improve upon our existing strengths and create the leaders of the future. )/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
